      {
        "author_name": "Lisa Robinson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102481424984656449083/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1AIrcPqqiLw1iORrZ2edupvxlfthYwxjuAp14jg-33xmBWWvs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 weeks ago",
        "text": "Took my UV/LED  nail course with Emanuelle, it was a one on one experience.  No need to share the teacher.\nI also went for electrolysis,  satisfied customer here.\nNext is my pedicure in 9 days  can't wait!  Highly recommend for several different services!",
        "time": 1769806906,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Shez S",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110749415524789189775/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIwUwbcfWdAErqTYDAAk7s1uKh0pmLqzwnt4Je5jyKyCHnwUZ4=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "My favourite salon, hands down. Manu has been doing my hair for over 20 years and she’s consistently fantastic—great cuts, great prices, and the most welcoming atmosphere. I get my nails done there now too, so it’s become a convenient one-stop shop. The whole team is lovely, the products are solid, and their candles are amazing (and affordable!). Definitely worth checking out.",
        "time": 1765064874,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Tania Leclerc",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101249862902208036880/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVgpn8ubdWwQt6_3_0upwJ_Jiuawe6-DxWo-qOMlIAHn9O8PQ0y=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I've been going to Beauté ManuCure for over two years, and the service is always impeccable. Manu is bubbly, patient, and extremely meticulous. Gabriel, for eyelash extensions, is so gentle and painstaking that you could easily fall asleep during the treatment!\nI always feel completely confident with the team members, and the welcome is warm every time I visit. It's truly THE place to pamper yourself. I recommend it to everyone without hesitation! 🥰",
        "time": 1768044367,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Brisebois",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116224444456150344178/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKLJ2tAtDRAggUFUBp-k8M_ZWlraKWBBS3rM2ku7Ylj6QhkIA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Wow! I loved my experience with Manu! She's truly talented, both for head spa treatments and nails. I've been seeing her for a few years now and I'm never disappointed 🥰 Everything is done with care and professionalism. It was extremely relaxing; I left feeling completely refreshed. I highly recommend her!",
        "time": 1768525190,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Truppak",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113484626690842476164/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLQtkZVzaVJowuewkba901T2--hETcgI_qc-eV9DS7WjmD9Tcs=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 months ago",
        "text": "Excellent, clean place with friendly service. Emmanuelle welcomed me warmly and explained the different options. She was patient and focused on my well-being, which I really appreciated.\n\nThe shop next door is also very interesting for buying products at the same time.\nI will return.",
